      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "More choice in how the locomotion behaves is never a bad request.\nAs a counter point to your request I find it easier to strafe move in games that follow the forward of the head. Meaning its still possible to walk and look around. Whereas games that have it coupled to the controller for example mean youre breaking your wrist to look around rather than natural joystick/touch movement. I've never seen something that follows the hip or other tracked point so that could be interesting.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
