      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f2e2ab863aa6f7311d53d03|full_name}: For me personally headset is also more comfortable than controller, I agree with that. But if there was an on/off option for using the hip (\"waist\") tracker I don't think that would inconvenience anyone.\nI do understand that it seems currently everything is based on the headset position so this might not be as trivial as it seems, but it's definitely worth implementing.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
